# ============================================================
# EOPW — Cloudflare redirects
# Format:  <source>  <destination>  <status>
# First match wins, evaluated top to bottom.
#
# NOTE ON URL SCHEME (verified 2026-11-09):
#   This host serves EXTENSIONLESS URLs. Every .html request returns
#   `307` to its extensionless twin — that is Cloudflare's documented
#   `html_handling: auto-trailing-slash` default, not a misconfiguration.
#   Cloudflare exposes no html_handling mode that preserves .html *and*
#   directory-index behavior, so extensionless is the scheme to adopt.
#   Therefore every destination below uses the extensionless form:
#   pointing a 301 at a .html URL would add a second hop (301 -> 307 -> 200).
#   See gsc-analysis-2026-11-09.md §13.
# ============================================================

# --- Canonical root -------------------------------------------------
/index.html                                   /                                         301


